    "detailed_description": "In <strong><i>Last Round</i></strong>, every round really could be your last...<br><br>Go head to head with other players dueling to become <strong>THE </strong>most feared outlaw in the world.<br><br><br>- <strong>Focus</strong>... As you stare-down your opponent, you'll need every last ounce of focus!<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1979490/extras/1c45927a8afeff650213f47b07713891.poster.avif?t=1690445652\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1979490/extras/1c45927a8afeff650213f47b07713891.webm?t=1690445652\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1979490/extras/1c45927a8afeff650213f47b07713891.mp4?t=1690445652\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>- <strong>Aim</strong>... Will you play it safe and aim for their flabby belly? Or will you take the risk and aim for a clean headshot, ending the duel instantly?<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1979490/extras/a4be9f5cf3ee8d0c7aeb9b0f11da958b.poster.avif?t=1690445652\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1979490/extras/a4be9f5cf3ee8d0c7aeb9b0f11da958b.webm?t=1690445652\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1979490/extras/a4be9f5cf3ee8d0c7aeb9b0f11da958b.mp4?t=1690445652\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>- <strong>DRAW</strong>! You'd better be feeling fast, because mistakes WILL cost you...<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1979490/extras/31c96b062809403a2c9ce64effa551e4.poster.avif?t=1690445652\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1979490/extras/31c96b062809403a2c9ce64effa551e4.webm?t=1690445652\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1979490/extras/31c96b062809403a2c9ce64effa551e4.mp4?t=1690445652\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>If you manage to become the most feared outlaw by the end of the month by winning countless life or death duels, then your character will forever be written into the <strong>Book Of The Feared</strong><br><br><br><br><br>--------------------------------------------------------------------<br><br>This game is a silly multiplayer cowboy game designed for the highly competitive person. <br><br>Explore the town and play minigames to build up enough guts to challenge other outlaws to a deadly duel.<br>There can only be one winner in these duels... the winner is dependent on your focus, decisions and speed.<br><br>For every outlaw you take down in these duels, you'll gain points of fear...<br><br>By the end of the month, the player with the most points of fear will be immortalized into the game, and will be crowned with an exclusive hat...<br><br>But one small mistake will cost you <strong>ALL </strong>of your points.<br><br><br>Buckle up, and <i>remember</i>... there can only be one '<strong>BEST</strong>' in the <strong>Wild West</strong>!",
